OL,3,AThree killed after LA news helicopter
OL,4,Acrashes while covering deadly bus
OL,5,Acollision
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe station's hosts said both people on
OL,8,Fthe helicopter, who were "valued
OL,9,Ffriends and colleagues" had died,
OL,10,Fnaming them as Eliana Moreno and George
OL,11,FMarciniw.
OL,13,FThey said the third victim was on the
OL,14,Fground at the time of the crash, but
OL,15,Fdid not name them.
